WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.386
On spot you buy the coin itself.

2
00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:04.676
A future is a contract on its price:

3
00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:07.985
there is no coin, only settlement of the difference.

4
00:00:07.985 --> 00:00:12.566
A dated future has a date by which the gap to the coin price disappears.

5
00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:16.574
A perpetual has no date, and funding ties it to the coin price.

6
00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:20.871
Funding is a regular payment between longs and shorts.

7
00:00:20.871 --> 00:00:23.436
When the crowd wants to buy with leverage,

8
00:00:23.436 --> 00:00:26.000
the rate is positive and longs pay shorts.

9
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.274
One hundredth of a percent per eight hours is about 11 percent a year,

10
00:00:30.274 --> 00:00:33.510
and in hot periods the rate can be many times higher.
